   "asset_url": null,
   "asset_sha256": null,
   "sheet": null,
   "row_index": null,
   "page": null,
   "raw_text": "FDG-avid right supraclavicular lymph node as well as multiple lytic bone lesions with diffusely increased bone marrow metabolic activity in the axial and peripheral skeleton"
  },
  {
   "cell_id": "b00019-c2",
   "origin": "article_table",
   "role": "value",
   "segment_id": "b00019",
   "table_id": "Tab1",
   "grid_row": "data",
   "column_index": 2,
   "supplement_id": null,
   "transcription_id": null,
   "asset_url": null,
   "asset_sha256": null,
   "sheet": null,
   "row_index": null,
   "page": null,
   "raw_text": "The right supraclavicular lymph node appears metabolically active but non-RAI-avid suggesting a possibility of having dedifferentiated features of the metastatic thyroid lesions. The ^(99m)Tc MIBI-avid superior mediastinal lesion was non-FDG-avid raising a possibility of ectopic parathyroid mass with multiple brown tumors"
  },
  {
   "cell_id": "b00019-c3",
   "origin": "article_table",
   "role": "value",
   "segment_id": "b00019",
   "table_id": "Tab1",
   "grid_row": "data",
   "column_index": 3,
   "supplement_id": null,
   "transcription_id": null,
   "asset_url": null,
   "asset_sha256": null,
   "sheet": null,
   "row_index": null,
   "page": null,
   "raw_text": "The mediastinal lesion: ectopic parathyroid adenoma The right supraclavicular lymph node: metastatic papillary thyroid carcinoma"
  },
